OL,3,AMan dies in crash after police pursuit
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died and a woman has been
OL,6,Fseriously hurt in a crash after a
OL,7,Fpolice pursuit near
OL,8,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,10,FOfficers tried to stop a black Audi on
OL,11,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,12,FBST on Monday but the driver failed to
OL,13,Fpull over, Warwickshire Police said.
OL,15,FA pursuit began and 15 minutes later
OL,16,Fthe Audi crashed into a white Ford
OL,17,FPuma, the force said, with the Audi's
OL,18,Fmale driver confirmed dead at the scene
OL,19,Fby paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
